### 获取指定任务的消息历史 [POST]

获取指定会话任务（Session Task）下的所有消息，包括用户消息和 AI 消息。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_task_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "messages": [
                    {
                        "role": "user",
                        "message": {
                            "id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348",
                            "user_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346",
                            "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                            "seq_index": 1,
                            "message_type": "text",
                            "content": "你好",
                            "status": "completed",
                            "session_task_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349",
                            "process_priority": 30,
                            "present_priority": 30,
                            "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                            "updated_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "message": {
                            "id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012350",
                            "user_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346",
                            "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                            "sub_seq_index": 1,
                            "message_type": "text",
                            "content": "你好！有什么可以帮助你的吗？",
                            "status": "completed",
                            "session_task_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349",
                            "present_priority": 30,
                            "json_content": null,
                            "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:01Z",
                            "updated_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:01Z"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话任务不存在"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

## 发送消息 [/chat/send_message]

### 发送消息 [POST]

发送消息到指定会话的指定分支。消息会自动关联到该分支的 pending 任务；若分支不存在则自动创建。该接口不调用语言模型进行实际的响应。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "message": "你好",
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_uuid": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "message_uuid": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348",
                "message_status": "waiting_agent_ack_user",
                "session_task_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349",
                "message": "消息发送成功"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "发送消息失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 处理未回复消息 [/chat/process_pending_messages]

### 处理未回复消息 [POST]

处理指定会话分支中还未被 AI 回复的消息。找到分支上 pending 状态的 Task，收集绑定到该 Task 的等待消息，更新状态并启动 AI 处理。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "session_task_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349",
                "processed_messages_id_status_map": {
                    "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348": "agent_working_for_user"
                },
                "total_processed": 1,
                "message": "未回复消息处理完成"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "没有待处理的消息"
            }

+ Response 409 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "当前分支有正在处理的任务"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "处理未回复消息时发生错误: 错误信息"
            }

## 聊天流式响应 [/chat/streaming]

### 获取 AI 流式响应 [POST]

建立 SSE (Server-Sent Events) 连接，实时接收指定会话任务的 AI 响应流。

支持断线续读：客户端重连时通过 `Last-Event-ID` 请求头传递上次最后接收的消息 ID，服务端从该位置继续推送。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Last-Event-ID: 1712000000000-0

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "session_task_id": "01945a1b-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-abcdef012345"
            }

+ Response 200 (text/event-stream)

    SSE 事件流。每条消息格式为 `event:类型\ndata:JSON\nid:消息ID\n\n`。

    + Headers

            Cache-Control: no-cache
            Connection: keep-alive

    + Body

            event:init
            retry:10

            event:text_delta
            data:{"type":"text_delta","content":"你好"}
            id:1712000000000-0

            event:text_delta
            data:{"type":"text_delta","content":"！"}
            id:1712000000001-0

+ Response 401 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "Not authenticated"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话不属于当前用户"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话任务不存在"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话任务不属于指定会话"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话任务未在运行， 任务状态completed"
            }

## 取消会话任务 [/chat/cancel_session_task]

### 取消正在运行的会话任务 [POST]

取消指定会话中正在处于 processing 状态的任务。仅当任务处于 processing 状态时才能取消。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "session_task_id": "01945a1b-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-abcdef012345"
            }

+ Response 200

    任务取消请求已发送。

+ Response 401 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "Not authenticated"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话不属于当前用户"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话任务不存在"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话任务不属于指定会话"
            }

            {
                "detail": "会话任务未在运行， 任务状态pending"
            }

## 更新会话标题 [/chat/sessions/update_title]

### 更新会话标题 [POST]

更新指定会话的标题。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "title": "新的会话标题"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "message": "会话标题更新成功",
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "new_title": "新的会话标题"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "更新会话标题失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 删除会话 [/chat/delete_session]

### 批量删除会话 [POST]

批量删除指定的会话及其关联数据（包括分支、任务、消息等）。返回每个会话的删除结果详情。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_ids": [
                    "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                    "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346"
                ]
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "total_requested": 2,
                "deleted_count": 1,
                "failed_count": 1,
                "results": [
                    {
                        "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                        "success": true,
                        "reason": null
                    },
                    {
                        "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346",
                        "success": false,
                        "reason": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
                    }
                ]
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "删除会话失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 分支列表 [/chat/sessions/{session_id}/branches]

### 获取会话分支列表 [GET]

获取指定会话的所有分支及其状态信息。返回每个分支的名称、状态（是否有处理中/等待中的任务、是否有未处理消息等）。默认隐藏以 `__` 开头的子代理分支，可通过 `include_hidden=true` 包含。

+ Parameters
    + session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID

+ Request

    + Body

            {
                "include_hidden": false
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "branches": [
                    {
                        "branch_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012347",
                        "branch_name": "main",
                        "raw_branch_name": "main",
                        "created_by": "user",
                        "is_hidden": false,
                        "archived": false,
                        "has_processing_task": false,
                        "has_pending_task": false,
                        "has_unprocessed_messages": false,
                        "last_terminal_status": "completed",
                        "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                        "updated_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
                    }
                ],
                "total_count": 1
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "获取分支列表失败: 错误信息"
            }

# Group 数据结构

## SessionResponse
+ id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ user_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346` (string, required) - 用户 UUID
+ title: `会话标题` (string, required) - 会话标题
+ archived: `false` (boolean, required) - 是否已归档
+ created_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 创建时间
+ updated_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 更新时间

## SessionListResponse
+ sessions (array[SessionResponse], required) - 会话列表

## CreateSessionRequest
+ title: `未命名的会话` (string, optional) - 会话标题

## CreateSessionResponse
+ session_uuid: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ created_new_session: `true` (boolean, required) - 是否创建了新会话
+ message: `会话创建成功` (string, required) - 操作消息

## UpdateSessionTitleRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ title: `新的会话标题` (string, required) - 新的会话标题

## SendMessageRequest
+ message: `你好` (string, required) - 消息内容，最小长度 1
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 分支名称，默认为 main

## SendMessageResponse
+ session_uuid: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ message_uuid: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348` (string, required) - 消息 UUID
+ message_status: `waiting_agent_ack_user` (enum[string], required) - 消息状态（含义与 [U2AUserMessage](#U2AUserMessage) 的 `status` 字段相同）
    + Members
        + `waiting_agent_ack_user` - 等待 Agent 确认用户消息
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349` (string, optional) - 关联的会话任务 ID
+ message: `消息发送成功` (string, required) - 操作消息

## ChatStreamingRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话任务 UUID

## CancelSessionTaskRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 要取消的会话任务 UUID

## ProcessPendingMessagesRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 分支名称，默认为 main

## ProcessPendingMessagesResponse
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349` (string, required) - 会话任务 ID
+ processed_messages_id_status_map (object, required) - 已处理消息的状态映射，键为消息 ID，值为状态字符串（状态含义与 [U2AUserMessage](#U2AUserMessage) 的 `status` 字段相同）
+ total_processed: `1` (number, required) - 已处理消息总数
+ message: `未回复消息处理完成` (string, required) - 操作消息

## SessionMessageHistoryRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 分支名称，默认为 main
+ limit: `50` (number, optional) - 返回消息数量限制
+ max_seq_index: `100` (number, optional) - 最大序号限制（需要同时提供 limit）

## SessionMessageHistoryResponse
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ messages (array[SessionMessageHistoryResponseItem], required) - 消息列表

## SessionMessageHistoryResponseItem
+ role: `user` (enum[string], required) - 消息角色，决定 `message` 字段的数据结构
    + Members
        + `user` - 用户消息，此时 `message` 为 [U2AUserMessage](#U2AUserMessage)
        + `assistant` - AI 消息，此时 `message` 为 [U2AAgentMessage](#U2AAgentMessage)
+ message (object, required) - 消息内容对象，具体结构由 `role` 决定

## U2AUserMessage

用户发送的消息对象。当 `role` 为 `user` 时，`message` 字段为此类型。

+ id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348` (string, required) - 消息 UUID
+ user_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346` (string, required) - 发送用户 UUID
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 所属会话 UUID
+ seq_index: `1` (number, required) - 消息在会话中的序号
+ message_type: `text` (string, required) - 消息类型
+ content: `你好` (string, required) - 消息内容
+ status: `completed` (enum[string], required) - 消息状态
    + Members
        + `waiting_agent_ack_user` - 等待 Agent 确认用户消息
        + `agent_working_for_user` - Agent 正在为用户处理消息
        + `completed` - 处理完成
        + `error` - 处理出错
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349` (string, optional) - 关联的会话任务 ID
+ process_priority: `30` (number, required) - 处理优先级
+ present_priority: `30` (number, required) - 展示优先级
+ created_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 创建时间
+ updated_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 更新时间

## U2AAgentMessage

AI Agent 发送的消息对象。当 `role` 为 `assistant` 时，`message` 字段为此类型。

+ id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012350` (string, required) - 消息 UUID
+ user_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346` (string, required) - 关联用户 UUID
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 所属会话 UUID
+ sub_seq_index: `1` (number, required) - 消息在任务中的子序号（同一任务可有多条 Agent 消息）
+ message_type: `text` (string, required) - 消息类型
+ content: `你好！有什么可以帮助你的吗？` (string, required) - 消息内容
+ status: `completed` (enum[string], required) - 消息状态
    + Members
        + `streaming` - 正在流式输出
        + `stop` - 已停止
        + `completed` - 处理完成
        + `error` - 处理出错
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349` (string, required) - 关联的会话任务 ID
+ present_priority: `30` (number, required) - 展示优先级
+ json_content: `null` (object, optional) - JSON 格式的结构化内容
+ created_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:01Z` (string, required) - 创建时间
+ updated_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:01Z` (string, required) - 更新时间

## GetProcessingTaskRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, required) - 分支名称

## ProcessingTaskInfo
+ id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346` (string, required) - 任务 ID
+ branch_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012347` (string, optional) - 所属分支 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 所属分支名称
+ created_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 创建时间
+ updated_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 更新时间

## GetProcessingTaskResponse
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ has_processing_task: `true` (boolean, required) - 是否有处理中任务
+ processing_tasks (array[ProcessingTaskInfo], required) - 处理中任务列表
+ total_count: `1` (number, required) - 处理中任务总数

## TaskMessageHistoryRequest
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349` (string, required) - 会话任务 ID

## DeleteSessionRequest
+ session_ids: `["01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345"]` (array[string], required) - 会话 ID 列表，至少包含一个

## DeleteSessionResult
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ success: `true` (boolean, required) - 是否删除成功
+ reason: `会话不存在或不属于当前用户` (string, optional) - 失败原因，成功时为 null

## DeleteSessionResponse
+ total_requested: `2` (number, required) - 请求删除的会话总数
+ deleted_count: `1` (number, required) - 成功删除的会话数
+ failed_count: `1` (number, required) - 删除失败的会话数
+ results (array[DeleteSessionResult], required) - 每个会话的删除结果

## BranchStatusInfo

分支状态信息。

+ branch_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012347` (string, required) - 分支 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, required) - 分支显示名称（已去除 UUID 后缀）
+ raw_branch_name: `main` (string, required) - 数据库中的原始分支名称
+ created_by: `user` (enum[string], required) - 创建者
    + Members
        + `user` - 由用户创建
        + `agent` - 由 AI Agent 创建
        + `system` - 由系统创建
+ is_hidden: `false` (boolean, required) - 是否为隐藏分支（名称以 `__` 开头）
+ archived: `false` (boolean, required) - 是否已归档
+ has_processing_task: `false` (boolean, required) - 分支上是否有 processing 状态的任务
+ has_pending_task: `false` (boolean, required) - 分支上是否有 pending 状态的任务
+ has_unprocessed_messages: `false` (boolean, required) - 分支上是否有待处理的用户消息
+ last_terminal_status: `completed` (enum[string], optional) - 最近一个非 pending/processing 任务的状态，无终态任务时为 null
    + Members
        + `completed` - 已完成
        + `failed` - 已失败
        + `cancelled` - 已取消
+ created_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 分支创建时间
+ updated_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 分支更新时间

## BranchListResponse

分支列表响应。

+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branches (array[BranchStatusInfo], required) - 分支状态列表
+ total_count: `1` (number, required) - 返回的分支总数（不含被过滤的隐藏分支）

## Error
+ detail: `错误信息` (string, required) - 错误详情
